 "Max": "Max",
 "Your data stays yours": "Sinu andmed jäävad sulle",
 "Liftr has no account, no server and no advertising. Your workouts, exercises, routines, body measurements and gym pass are stored on your device and in your own private iCloud.": "Liftril pole kontot, serverit ega reklaame. Sinu treeningud, harjutused, kavad, kehamõõdud ja jõusaalikaart salvestatakse sinu seadmesse ja sinu enda privaatsesse iCloudi.",
 "Only with your permission, Liftr reads your weight, body composition and resting heart rate, and saves workouts, calories, distance and weight. Health data never leaves your devices through Liftr and is never used for advertising. You can change access at any time in the Health app.": "Ainult sinu loal loeb Liftr sinu kaalu, keha koostist ja puhkeoleku pulssi ning salvestab treeningud, kalorid, vahemaa ja kaalu. Terviseandmed ei lahku Liftri kaudu kunagi sinu seadmetest ja neid ei kasutata kunagi reklaamiks. Juurdepääsu saad igal ajal muuta rakenduses Tervis.",
 "iCloud": "iCloud",
 "Syncing between your iPhone, iPad and Apple Watch goes through your private iCloud database. The developer cannot see this data. The code of your gym pass is end-to-end encrypted.": "Sünkroonimine sinu iPhone'i, iPadi ja Apple Watchi vahel käib sinu privaatse iCloudi andmebaasi kaudu. Arendaja ei näe neid andmeid. Sinu jõusaalikaardi kood on otspunktkrüptitud.",
 "Camera and photos": "Kaamera ja fotod",
 "The camera and your photos are only used to read the code of your gym pass. Images are not saved or sent anywhere.": "Kaamerat ja sinu fotosid kasutatakse ainult jõusaalikaardi koodi lugemiseks. Pilte ei salvestata ega saadeta kuhugi.",
 "Notifications": "Teavitused",
 "Reminders and the rest timer are planned on your device. There is no push server.": "Meeldetuletused ja puhkeaja taimer ajastatakse sinu seadmes. Push-serverit pole.",
 "No tracking": "Jälgimist pole",
 "Liftr contains no analytics, no third-party code and no tracking of any kind.": "Liftr ei sisalda analüütikat, kolmandate osapoolte koodi ega mingit jälgimist.",
 "Deleting your data": "Andmete kustutamine",
 "Delete workouts in the app. To remove everything, delete Liftr and remove its data in Settings → your name → iCloud → Manage Storage.": "Kustuta treeninguid rakenduses. Et kõik eemaldada, kustuta Liftr ja eemalda selle andmed: Seaded → sinu nimi → iCloud → Halda salvestusruumi.",
 "Privacy": "Privaatsus",
 "Liftr is built to keep your training private.": "Liftr on loodud hoidma sinu treeningud privaatsena.",
 "Questions?": "Küsimusi?",
 "Last updated: November 2026": "Viimati uuendatud: november 2026",
 "Waiting for internet": "Ootan internetiühendust",
 "iCloud storage is full": "iCloudi salvestusruum on täis",
 "iCloud isn't set up yet": "iCloud pole veel seadistatud",
 "iCloud is busy. Liftr tries again automatically; your workouts are safe on this device.": "iCloud on hõivatud. Liftr proovib automaatselt uuesti; sinu treeningud on selles seadmes kindlas kohas.",
 "Your workouts sync as soon as you're online again.": "Sinu treeningud sünkroonitakse kohe, kui oled jälle võrgus.",
 "Free up space in iCloud to keep syncing. Your workouts are safe on this device.": "Vabasta iCloudis ruumi, et sünkroonimine jätkuks. Sinu treeningud on selles seadmes kindlas kohas.",
 "This version of Liftr can't save to iCloud yet. Your workouts are safe on this device and sync once this is fixed.": "See Liftri versioon ei saa veel iCloudi salvestada. Sinu treeningud on selles seadmes kindlas kohas ja sünkroonitakse, kui see on parandatud.",
